{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01DnxVfoSJV4bcEPKfZunyCv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixed. The failure was a single bug in the `//go:generate protoc` directive.\n\n## Root cause\n\nThe directive passed **no `--proto_path` (`-I`)** flag:\n\n```\n//go:generate protoc --go_out=../.. ... ../../proto/v1/pricing.proto\n```\n\n`go generate` runs the directive from `cmd/pricing/`, so protoc defaulted its proto_path to that directory — which doesn't contain `../../proto/v1/pricing.proto`. Hence:\n\n> `File does not reside within any path specified using --proto_path`\n\nThe previous attempt never exercised `go generate` (it ran pre-generated `.pb.go` files through `go test`), so the broken directive went unnoticed — but the checker's `go generate ./...` step hit it immediately.\n\n## Fix\n\n`cmd/pricing/main.go:5` — added `-I../..` (the service dir) as the proto_path and made the file argument relative to it:\n\n```\n//go:generate protoc -I../.. --go_out=../.. --go_opt=module=agentbench/services/pricing --go-grpc_out=../.. --go-grpc_opt=module=agentbench/services/pricing proto/v1/pricing.proto\n```\n\n`../..` from `cmd/pricing/` is the service root, which encompasses `proto/v1/pricing.proto`, so protoc resolves the canonical name correctly and `module=` strips the prefix to land stubs in `api/v1/`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `go generate ./...` → exit 0, regenerates `api/v1/pricing.pb.go` + `pricing_grpc.pb.go`\n- `go build ./...` → clean\n- `go test ./...` → `ok` (server tests pass)\n- No other protoc references in Makefile/Dockerfile — they delegate to `go generate`, which now works.\n\nThe checker's `go generate ./...` → `go test` flow is now green."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":369,"cache_read_input_tokens":80064,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":369},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"066ca3de-909b-43d8-8241-f6766f036537","uuid":"e3a641ce-8276-4793-a19d-53f2b042070a","request_id":"req_011CbpcegcmJjP7GUqQ8LJuy"}
